(6372812, 944418, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the rock that frames the edges of the photo. Being so far away with the focal length is not bad but I think it could have been shot closer without so much blank sky that really doesn''t add anything to the photo. The girl is looking out at something, but it just looks like she is looking at blank sky.</td>', 'I like the rock that frames the edges of the photo. Being so far away with the focal length is not bad but I think it could have been shot closer without so much blank sky that really doesn''t add anything to the photo. The girl is looking out at something, but it just looks like she is looking at blank sky.', '2011-04-04 13:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6372815, 944543, 10785, '<td valign="top">I''m not catching your artistic vision and connection with the title. It''s not you, it''s me. I kind of relate the board to the tree and think you meant something by that difference. Even though the meaning is lost, you got good texture but it''s a little dark overall.</td>', 'I''m not catching your artistic vision and connection with the title. It''s not you, it''s me. I kind of relate the board to the tree and think you meant something by that difference. Even though the meaning is lost, you got good texture but it''s a little dark overall.', '2011-04-04 13:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
