(6373265, 944540, 66641, '<td valign="top">Hmm...I think this would have worked better with a different set up, and I don''t like seeing that wall.  I do like the reflection caught in the guitar though.</td>', 'Hmm...I think this would have worked better with a different set up, and I don''t like seeing that wall.  I do like the reflection caught in the guitar though.', '2011-04-04 19:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
