(6373311, 944382, 5112, '<td valign="top">I really wish there was a little more light on both the girl and the dog!  The scene is beautiful, but the two (dog/girl) are just a bit too much in the shadow for it to work (for me).</td>', 'I really wish there was a little more light on both the girl and the dog!  The scene is beautiful, but the two (dog/girl) are just a bit too much in the shadow for it to work (for me).', '2011-04-04 20:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
