(6373581, 944324, 66641, '<td valign="top">Creative, and I love the idea, but could I suggest a different outfit for a shot like this next time?  I feel like you went to great lengths to set this up and then didn''t want to bother to change out of your work clothes.  I wish you had found some unusual outfit to go with this unusual and great concept.  Still a 7 for me though.<br/> <br/>edit - this may not be you, don''t know why I assumed so ;)</td>', 'Creative, and I love the idea, but could I suggest a different outfit for a shot like this next time?  I feel like you went to great lengths to set this up and then didn''t want to bother to change out of your work clothes.  I wish you had found some unusual outfit to go with this unusual and great concept.  Still a 7 for me though. edit - this may not be you, don''t know why I assumed so ;)', '2011-04-04 22:02:40.000000', NULL, 1);
