(6373612, 944116, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think that the title along with your photo is an artistic statement on the state of manhood and on being a modern husband in the western world. In our modern female dominated culture, manhood has been kicked to the back of the bus... and don''t dare speak your mind about the subject or risk being labeled a wussy who can''t take it or just the opposite, a woman hating oppressor. All in all, manliness is missing from our culture today!<br/> <br/>( I could be way off too!!)</td>', 'I think that the title along with your photo is an artistic statement on the state of manhood and on being a modern husband in the western world. In our modern female dominated culture, manhood has been kicked to the back of the bus... and don''t dare speak your mind about the subject or risk being labeled a wussy who can''t take it or just the opposite, a woman hating oppressor. All in all, manliness is missing from our culture today! ( I could be way off too!!)', '2011-04-04 22:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6373639, 943211, 96751, '<td valign="top">Mysterious and foreboding.  It''s coming to attack me.</td>', 'Mysterious and foreboding.  It''s coming to attack me.', '2011-04-04 22:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6373642, 944430, 10785, '<td valign="top">This shot had so much potential but I gave this a 5.... A longer focal length is needed to get closer. The wires take away from the shot. If you could have framed to crop them out it would have scored higher in my book. The B&amp;W conversion is excellent with deep black tones in the shadows and nice highlights and midtone greys. The eagle, who is the star of the show, is barely noticeable among the clutter...</td>', 'This shot had so much potential but I gave this a 5.... A longer focal length is needed to get closer. The wires take away from the shot. If you could have framed to crop them out it would have scored higher in my book. The B&W conversion is excellent with deep black tones in the shadows and nice highlights and midtone greys. The eagle, who is the star of the show, is barely noticeable among the clutter...', '2011-04-04 22:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6373644, 944402, 10785, '<td valign="top">interesting artwork... but the plant... couldn''t it have been moved out of the way??</td>', 'interesting artwork... but the plant... couldn''t it have been moved out of the way??', '2011-04-04 22:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
