(6374505, 944456, 60173, '<td valign="top">I really like the DOF. Shots like this have been growing on me lately. Many would say that there''s too much emptiness and that it should be a tighter crop, but that''s just it; empty. It''s a great way to show isolation. There''s also an interesting subtle X formed by leading lines here.</td>', 'I really like the DOF. Shots like this have been growing on me lately. Many would say that there''s too much emptiness and that it should be a tighter crop, but that''s just it; empty. It''s a great way to show isolation. There''s also an interesting subtle X formed by leading lines here.', '2011-04-05 07:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
