(6374595, 944147, 15711, '<td valign="top">Probably one of the better ones of the challenge.  I was worried to do a warm BW for fear the words "gray" in the description would be taken literally by so many of the voters.  This is really good.  I love the guy in mid stride, and his position in the shot.  Nice composition.  That - in the circle keeps pulling my eye to it.  Nice juxtaposition with the guy. The invisible diagonal line that connects them makes for a good photo in my opinion. 8</td>', 'Probably one of the better ones of the challenge.  I was worried to do a warm BW for fear the words "gray" in the description would be taken literally by so many of the voters.  This is really good.  I love the guy in mid stride, and his position in the shot.  Nice composition.  That - in the circle keeps pulling my eye to it.  Nice juxtaposition with the guy. The invisible diagonal line that connects them makes for a good photo in my opinion. 8', '2011-04-05 10:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
