(6374664, 944052, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think I might''ve made it less of a square and cropped off some of the area at top and bottom. I like the subject matter but to me, it seems a bit "floating" with so much negative space around the woman and her cute pooch. Or maybe if they weren''t centered.  Hope this is helpful. :) 6</td>', 'I think I might''ve made it less of a square and cropped off some of the area at top and bottom. I like the subject matter but to me, it seems a bit "floating" with so much negative space around the woman and her cute pooch. Or maybe if they weren''t centered.  Hope this is helpful. :) 6', '2011-04-05 10:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
