(6374679, 943888, 15711, '<td valign="top">Outstanding.  Probably (to me) the best in the challenge.  The centering of her face is perfect here. I like the symmetry of her arms to add that sense of balance. Love the catch lights and the lighting is smooth and suits her sweet face.  The tutu in the background is a great backdrop and helps add to the story of this portrait.  Nice work. 9</td>', 'Outstanding.  Probably (to me) the best in the challenge.  The centering of her face is perfect here. I like the symmetry of her arms to add that sense of balance. Love the catch lights and the lighting is smooth and suits her sweet face.  The tutu in the background is a great backdrop and helps add to the story of this portrait.  Nice work. 9', '2011-04-05 10:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
