(6376048, 943739, 119419, '<td valign="top">Nice clean lines, well executed, good contrasts but is a little lacking in something to lock onto as a point of interest. All of it is the point of interest so I feel a little lost. But regardless, a good effort.</td>', 'Nice clean lines, well executed, good contrasts but is a little lacking in something to lock onto as a point of interest. All of it is the point of interest so I feel a little lost. But regardless, a good effort.', '2011-04-06 03:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
