(6376063, 943462, 119419, '<td valign="top">Maybe seen that mask b4 ;) like the slight sepia toning, good use of a hard lighting situation esp to tone up the body, maybe u put a light in there. Not a big fan of the masks myself, I would have used the real face but that''s me. Good framing, though a tad more space on the right side would be good. Thanks for the effort, appreciated.</td>', 'Maybe seen that mask b4 ;) like the slight sepia toning, good use of a hard lighting situation esp to tone up the body, maybe u put a light in there. Not a big fan of the masks myself, I would have used the real face but that''s me. Good framing, though a tad more space on the right side would be good. Thanks for the effort, appreciated.', '2011-04-06 03:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
