(6376067, 944583, 119419, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the light, though a little harsh on the urn itself, maybe the negative space is a bit too strong for the rest of the image but that may be what you intended. Like it.</td>', 'Nice use of the light, though a little harsh on the urn itself, maybe the negative space is a bit too strong for the rest of the image but that may be what you intended. Like it.', '2011-04-06 03:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
