(6376167, 943783, 108069, '<td valign="top">Strong geometrical shapes and strong contrast between lights and darks and circles and squares/rectanlges. Really unique perspective. The plane is a nice touch as well. Great shot.</td>', 'Strong geometrical shapes and strong contrast between lights and darks and circles and squares/rectanlges. Really unique perspective. The plane is a nice touch as well. Great shot.', '2011-04-06 06:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
