(6376255, 944596, 119419, '<td valign="top">Looks very Nixter to me. Brilliant blacks, definition and wonderful tonal range in such a small tonal band (does that make sense ? does to me ;) Love the pidgy and the water shapes, just perfect.</td>', 'Looks very Nixter to me. Brilliant blacks, definition and wonderful tonal range in such a small tonal band (does that make sense ? does to me ;) Love the pidgy and the water shapes, just perfect.', '2011-04-06 09:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376260, 944588, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. There''s a great feeling of power, though it was likely a very peaceful scene. I love the dark, moody tones, contrasting rays. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. There''s a great feeling of power, though it was likely a very peaceful scene. I love the dark, moody tones, contrasting rays. Well done.', '2011-04-06 09:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376276, 944357, 113156, '<td valign="top">Interesting portrait, good contrast.</td>', 'Interesting portrait, good contrast.', '2011-04-06 09:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376280, 944556, 113156, '<td valign="top">The shadow of the ball is amazing, and the concentration on his face intense, really good capture.</td>', 'The shadow of the ball is amazing, and the concentration on his face intense, really good capture.', '2011-04-06 09:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376302, 943360, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. Beautiful shot, with interesting textural contrast between the fluffy clouds and the smooth snow with jagged ridge line.<br/> <br/>Two criticisms: I''d like to see some greater extremes of black and white. Some greater contrast from slope to slope and cloud to cloud would make this pop quite a bit more. I think a levels adjustment is in order. It seems very low-contrast and locked in the midrange. It could use a greater spread I think.<br/> <br/>Also, I see a bit of noise in the clouds. A bit of blur tool would knock that out quickly, or of course noise ninja or neat image, or even a simple gausian blur.<br/> <br/>Sweet shot though.<br/> <br/>Just commenting, not voting.</td>', 'Nice subject. Beautiful shot, with interesting textural contrast between the fluffy clouds and the smooth snow with jagged ridge line. Two criticisms: I''d like to see some greater extremes of black and white. Some greater contrast from slope to slope and cloud to cloud would make this pop quite a bit more. I think a levels adjustment is in order. It seems very low-contrast and locked in the midrange. It could use a greater spread I think. Also, I see a bit of noise in the clouds. A bit of blur tool would knock that out quickly, or of course noise ninja or neat image, or even a simple gausian blur. Sweet shot though. Just commenting, not voting.', '2011-04-06 10:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376348, 944350, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is quite nice. Excellent low key treatment. It''s amazing how it''s just the bare essentials that remain, yet they are present in their entirety. Perfectly lit and executed.</td>', 'This is quite nice. Excellent low key treatment. It''s amazing how it''s just the bare essentials that remain, yet they are present in their entirety. Perfectly lit and executed.', '2011-04-06 10:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
