(6377620, 944378, 108069, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones. I like the high key effect of the hills in the distance. Just a hint. The lack of the vignette in teh top right corner at first felt off balance, but it gives it a sense of motion, as though that is falling back into the mist and the breakwater is coming toward the viewer. It''s interesting.<br/> <br/>If it had a vignette I think it would be a bit more peaceful, but considering it''s so peaceful as it is this adds an interesting twist.<br/> <br/>Very cool photo.</td>', 'Lovely tones. I like the high key effect of the hills in the distance. Just a hint. The lack of the vignette in teh top right corner at first felt off balance, but it gives it a sense of motion, as though that is falling back into the mist and the breakwater is coming toward the viewer. It''s interesting. If it had a vignette I think it would be a bit more peaceful, but considering it''s so peaceful as it is this adds an interesting twist. Very cool photo.', '2011-04-07 11:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
