(6379070, 944265, 11769, '<td valign="top">The base of the trunk looks like the perfect seat. Sit, lean back and close my eyes. Feel the warm sun and listen to the breeze. Birds add some high notes to natures symphony. I fall asleep and dream. The tree is talking to me about the pure ecstasy of it''s life, standing on this patch of ground gently touching it''s friends. And the tree tells me how grateful it is that I would take the time to sit here and listen to it''s story.<br/>After a time I awaken to a new understanding of just how beautiful this tree is.</td>', 'The base of the trunk looks like the perfect seat. Sit, lean back and close my eyes. Feel the warm sun and listen to the breeze. Birds add some high notes to natures symphony. I fall asleep and dream. The tree is talking to me about the pure ecstasy of it''s life, standing on this patch of ground gently touching it''s friends. And the tree tells me how grateful it is that I would take the time to sit here and listen to it''s story.After a time I awaken to a new understanding of just how beautiful this tree is.', '2011-04-08 10:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
