(6380261, 944471, 116649, '<td valign="top">A wonderous bird is a Pellican.  His mouth can hold more than his bellycan! He can hold in his beak enough food for a week, but I sure don''t know how hellican!</td>', 'A wonderous bird is a Pellican.  His mouth can hold more than his bellycan! He can hold in his beak enough food for a week, but I sure don''t know how hellican!', '2011-04-09 11:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380267, 944556, 116649, '<td valign="top">Nice catcth (or hit, or HR, or whatever it was!)</td>', 'Nice catcth (or hit, or HR, or whatever it was!)', '2011-04-09 11:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380277, 944090, 116649, '<td valign="top">I thought I was looking at a river, and my orientation was off, but I assume now I see a waterfall...  Either way, beautiful capture!</td>', 'I thought I was looking at a river, and my orientation was off, but I assume now I see a waterfall...  Either way, beautiful capture!', '2011-04-09 11:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380278, 944430, 104230, '<td valign="top">Nice textures and silhouettes.  For my eyes, it appears slightly over sharpened, but the image evokes the feeling of this being a special moment.</td>', 'Nice textures and silhouettes.  For my eyes, it appears slightly over sharpened, but the image evokes the feeling of this being a special moment.', '2011-04-09 11:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380281, 944549, 116649, '<td valign="top">Nice find!  Unless you composed it, in which case you have way too much time on your hands!</td>', 'Nice find!  Unless you composed it, in which case you have way too much time on your hands!', '2011-04-09 11:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380293, 944287, 76335, '<td valign="top">A bit too much negative space for me. The photographers are distant and shadowy, and it''s hard to make out exactly what''s going on.</td>', 'A bit too much negative space for me. The photographers are distant and shadowy, and it''s hard to make out exactly what''s going on.', '2011-04-09 11:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380294, 944535, 76335, '<td valign="top">Kaleidoscopic in black and white. It glows.</td>', 'Kaleidoscopic in black and white. It glows.', '2011-04-09 11:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380297, 943676, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The little details make this very interesting -- the shadows along the foreground crest, for instance. And do I see skiers? I certainly see ski trails... <br/> <br/>A six for you. (And if my assumption is correct that this is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=123833" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">marnet</a>, this appeals to me in a way that your Free Study entry doesn''t. That''s not to say that this is "better," just that it''s my preference of the two.)</td>', 'Very nice. The little details make this very interesting -- the shadows along the foreground crest, for instance. And do I see skiers? I certainly see ski trails...  A six for you. (And if my assumption is correct that this is  marnet, this appeals to me in a way that your Free Study entry doesn''t. That''s not to say that this is "better," just that it''s my preference of the two.)', '2011-04-09 11:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380302, 943999, 76335, '<td valign="top">Damn, that''s good. Nine.</td>', 'Damn, that''s good. Nine.', '2011-04-09 11:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380303, 944367, 76335, '<td valign="top">I do like dogs in black and white. The more lively, the better. (This goes back to having Fleetwood Mac''s <i>Tusk</i> album as a kid.)</td>', 'I do like dogs in black and white. The more lively, the better. (This goes back to having Fleetwood Mac''s Tusk album as a kid.)', '2011-04-09 11:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380305, 944557, 76335, '<td valign="top">I suspect your other commenters are crying out for more sharpness and contrast. But I like the simplicity and honesty of this. Nicely understated.</td>', 'I suspect your other commenters are crying out for more sharpness and contrast. But I like the simplicity and honesty of this. Nicely understated.', '2011-04-09 11:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380309, 944213, 76335, '<td valign="top">Feels a bit overexposed, but I do like the composition.</td>', 'Feels a bit overexposed, but I do like the composition.', '2011-04-09 11:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380313, 944591, 76335, '<td valign="top">Such a hardened, fierce -- and almost (but not quite) fearful -- expression.</td>', 'Such a hardened, fierce -- and almost (but not quite) fearful -- expression.', '2011-04-09 11:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380317, 944405, 76335, '<td valign="top">Love all that sweeping, horizontal energy.</td>', 'Love all that sweeping, horizontal energy.', '2011-04-09 12:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380319, 943347, 104230, '<td valign="top">Fascinating image and great processing, Johanna.  The 3-dimensionality of this is just amazing, I can "feel" the roundness of the lower part of the thumb and the tension of the finger tips pressing into the palm. (Not voting).</td>', 'Fascinating image and great processing, Johanna.  The 3-dimensionality of this is just amazing, I can "feel" the roundness of the lower part of the thumb and the tension of the finger tips pressing into the palm. (Not voting).', '2011-04-09 12:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380324, 944245, 76335, '<td valign="top">I envy people who can do this consistently without a.) becoming predictable, or b.) running out of buildings. Lots to enjoy here. It''s the shadowy, chaotic area in the lower left that sets this off.</td>', 'I envy people who can do this consistently without a.) becoming predictable, or b.) running out of buildings. Lots to enjoy here. It''s the shadowy, chaotic area in the lower left that sets this off.', '2011-04-09 12:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380325, 944319, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great idea but much too sharp.</td>', 'Great idea but much too sharp.', '2011-04-09 12:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380329, 944115, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. I wish only for a tighter crop at the bottom -- a little less neck (don''t get me wrong, it''s a nice neck...).</td>', 'Beautifully done. I wish only for a tighter crop at the bottom -- a little less neck (don''t get me wrong, it''s a nice neck...).', '2011-04-09 12:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380333, 944546, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice rhythm and texture and DOF. Feels like it''s leaning slightly to the right.</td>', 'Nice rhythm and texture and DOF. Feels like it''s leaning slightly to the right.', '2011-04-09 12:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380342, 944246, 76335, '<td valign="top">Oh, they do make a lovely couple. Great title too.</td>', 'Oh, they do make a lovely couple. Great title too.', '2011-04-09 12:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380345, 944489, 76335, '<td valign="top">Reaching for the sky. It''s futile of course. And the sky is clearly not amused. <br/> <br/>A fairy tale of a landscape.</td>', 'Reaching for the sky. It''s futile of course. And the sky is clearly not amused.  A fairy tale of a landscape.', '2011-04-09 12:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380348, 944586, 76335, '<td valign="top">They occupy the frame so nicely. Perfect composition.</td>', 'They occupy the frame so nicely. Perfect composition.', '2011-04-09 12:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380354, 944424, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the simple patterns and shapes. Wouldn''t some striped pants have been nice? I got lucky that way once. Anyway...</td>', 'I like the simple patterns and shapes. Wouldn''t some striped pants have been nice? I got lucky that way once. Anyway...', '2011-04-09 12:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380355, 944284, 76335, '<td valign="top">That Wladimir''s a lucky guy. But his timing''s bad.</td>', 'That Wladimir''s a lucky guy. But his timing''s bad.', '2011-04-09 12:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380358, 944103, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mid-key processing. No contrast necessary.</td>', 'Beautiful mid-key processing. No contrast necessary.', '2011-04-09 12:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380359, 944181, 76335, '<td valign="top">That''s one rollercoaster of a tree.</td>', 'That''s one rollercoaster of a tree.', '2011-04-09 12:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380363, 944430, 76335, '<td valign="top">Feels like a too tight crop on the bottom...</td>', 'Feels like a too tight crop on the bottom...', '2011-04-09 12:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380366, 943787, 76335, '<td valign="top">Lighting is very harsh...</td>', 'Lighting is very harsh...', '2011-04-09 12:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380374, 944324, 76335, '<td valign="top">Early congrats on your ribbon.</td>', 'Early congrats on your ribbon.', '2011-04-09 12:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380381, 944090, 76335, '<td valign="top">At first glance, I thought this was a tree trunk. The tiny birds set me straight. Very nice.</td>', 'At first glance, I thought this was a tree trunk. The tiny birds set me straight. Very nice.', '2011-04-09 12:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380386, 943623, 76335, '<td valign="top">Black and white shows us things here that a color image never could. The stripes, of course. The inky, imperfect lines. The freckles and smears. Perfect.</td>', 'Black and white shows us things here that a color image never could. The stripes, of course. The inky, imperfect lines. The freckles and smears. Perfect.', '2011-04-09 12:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380388, 944407, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love the way the light penetrates the rickety thing. Nice.</td>', 'I love the way the light penetrates the rickety thing. Nice.', '2011-04-09 12:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380390, 944446, 76335, '<td valign="top">Like bubbles or maybe magical clouds. Nice.</td>', 'Like bubbles or maybe magical clouds. Nice.', '2011-04-09 12:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380391, 944568, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the telephoto view of this. Like a surprising find through binoculars. Great title.</td>', 'I like the telephoto view of this. Like a surprising find through binoculars. Great title.', '2011-04-09 12:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380392, 944071, 76335, '<td valign="top">The eyes are penetrating. The expression, one of reckless confidence. Frame could be larger.</td>', 'The eyes are penetrating. The expression, one of reckless confidence. Frame could be larger.', '2011-04-09 12:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380402, 944120, 114225, '<td valign="top">Excellent contrasts.</td>', 'Excellent contrasts.', '2011-04-09 13:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380407, 944568, 104230, '<td valign="top">Some lovely textures and tones here.  I find the tree in front and what I assume is an part of an out of focus tree on the left rather distracting though.</td>', 'Some lovely textures and tones here.  I find the tree in front and what I assume is an part of an out of focus tree on the left rather distracting though.', '2011-04-09 13:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380408, 944307, 104230, '<td valign="top">Interesting shapes here.  I like the juxtaposition of sharper horizontal lines with the softer vertical elements.  The title suggests you used some software to modify the dynamic range. I might have preferred a wider tonal range with more darker tones. On initial viewing this just seemed too gray, but it is growing on me!</td>', 'Interesting shapes here.  I like the juxtaposition of sharper horizontal lines with the softer vertical elements.  The title suggests you used some software to modify the dynamic range. I might have preferred a wider tonal range with more darker tones. On initial viewing this just seemed too gray, but it is growing on me!', '2011-04-09 13:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380586, 943902, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great capture of a great scene. I like how you balanced the exposure here, something not easy with that bright white snow.</td>', 'Great capture of a great scene. I like how you balanced the exposure here, something not easy with that bright white snow.', '2011-04-09 15:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380587, 944198, 114225, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject for this challenge. I like the hard lighting in this case, as the shadow on the milk is a must have.</td>', 'Excellent subject for this challenge. I like the hard lighting in this case, as the shadow on the milk is a must have.', '2011-04-09 15:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380602, 944373, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like how the black and white has turned the blue skies with wispy clouds into something with more character.</td>', 'I like how the black and white has turned the blue skies with wispy clouds into something with more character.', '2011-04-09 15:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380718, 944381, 124982, '<td valign="top">Absolutely superb detail in the cow, my goodness!! The ground though looks a little over-processed and artifacty.</td>', 'Absolutely superb detail in the cow, my goodness!! The ground though looks a little over-processed and artifacty.', '2011-04-09 18:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380721, 944217, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very interesting architecture! Quite bizarre! Lovely lighting and tones.</td>', 'Very interesting architecture! Quite bizarre! Lovely lighting and tones.', '2011-04-09 18:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380795, 944323, 104230, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between the soft petals and the sharp spikes, and between the light and dark areas.  The flower seems out of focus but the spikes are in focus, which is confusing given your title.  Great subject for a photograph.</td>', 'Nice contrast between the soft petals and the sharp spikes, and between the light and dark areas.  The flower seems out of focus but the spikes are in focus, which is confusing given your title.  Great subject for a photograph.', '2011-04-09 20:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380870, 944578, 127674, '<td valign="top">I love the almost infinite depth of this shot!</td>', 'I love the almost infinite depth of this shot!', '2011-04-09 23:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380873, 944095, 124815, '<td valign="top">Admirable. 10</td>', 'Admirable. 10', '2011-04-09 23:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380874, 943774, 124815, '<td valign="top">Quite Orwellian. Excellent. 9</td>', 'Quite Orwellian. Excellent. 9', '2011-04-09 23:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6380876, 944471, 124815, '<td valign="top">A splendid capture. Flloating silently above oily waters.</td>', 'A splendid capture. Flloating silently above oily waters.', '2011-04-09 23:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
