(6381084, 944398, 101702, '<td valign="top">Looks like she is about to cry.... what did you do to her?! I would have preferred if the hand was doing something different... maybe folded slightly and resting her chin on her knuckles would look more natural.</td>', 'Looks like she is about to cry.... what did you do to her?! I would have preferred if the hand was doing something different... maybe folded slightly and resting her chin on her knuckles would look more natural.', '2011-04-10 08:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381087, 944500, 117474, '<td valign="top">Again, the only thing I can think about saying is that the quality of the final jpeg isn''t very good--looking at the lines going up it''s quite stair-cased. <br/>I think it''s a nice image though. I like the tree on the bottom and the sky on top is nice. It''s not the most interesting shot I''ve ever seen if I''m being honest. And you''ve got a nice perspective going on too.</td>', 'Again, the only thing I can think about saying is that the quality of the final jpeg isn''t very good--looking at the lines going up it''s quite stair-cased. I think it''s a nice image though. I like the tree on the bottom and the sky on top is nice. It''s not the most interesting shot I''ve ever seen if I''m being honest. And you''ve got a nice perspective going on too.', '2011-04-10 08:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381089, 943754, 117474, '<td valign="top">My own personal view about this shot is that I''d like to have seen a bit more of the skull to the right. I can understand that you probably intentionally lit it like this (might incline a viewer to consider uncertainty about life/death etc) but for me it would have added to the shot.</td>', 'My own personal view about this shot is that I''d like to have seen a bit more of the skull to the right. I can understand that you probably intentionally lit it like this (might incline a viewer to consider uncertainty about life/death etc) but for me it would have added to the shot.', '2011-04-10 08:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381091, 943490, 117474, '<td valign="top">Who else could this be but Mr. Hahn? <br/>Wonderful composure here. I think the shot would have benefitted if you were about 20 feet taller :-) But still great. I think it''s the best of the landscapes in black and white here. The rest have made me want to see them in colour, but this doesn''t need it for me.</td>', 'Who else could this be but Mr. Hahn? Wonderful composure here. I think the shot would have benefitted if you were about 20 feet taller :-) But still great. I think it''s the best of the landscapes in black and white here. The rest have made me want to see them in colour, but this doesn''t need it for me.', '2011-04-10 08:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381093, 943429, 117474, '<td valign="top">Great great shot, expression, texture lighting. I think perhaps one of the better ties to the challenge description in here. Wonderful. I think you''re getting 10 and a fav for this.</td>', 'Great great shot, expression, texture lighting. I think perhaps one of the better ties to the challenge description in here. Wonderful. I think you''re getting 10 and a fav for this.', '2011-04-10 08:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381097, 943758, 117474, '<td valign="top">Lots of appeal to this shot! Excellent processing and subject. <br/>It''s difficult, for me especially, to take a shot like this with so much going on, but to have the focal point stationary on, in this case, the child. I normally cheat by using narrow DOF, but in a case like this I''d lose so much of what the story the photo would otherwise tell. So kudos! <br/>Great pose. Great candid shot. Might come back and fav this later, but for now you''re getting a 9.<br/>Yeah. 10 and fav.</td>', 'Lots of appeal to this shot! Excellent processing and subject. It''s difficult, for me especially, to take a shot like this with so much going on, but to have the focal point stationary on, in this case, the child. I normally cheat by using narrow DOF, but in a case like this I''d lose so much of what the story the photo would otherwise tell. So kudos! Great pose. Great candid shot. Might come back and fav this later, but for now you''re getting a 9.Yeah. 10 and fav.', '2011-04-10 08:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381098, 943920, 117474, '<td valign="top">Even at this distance I think I recognise the-too on the edges... Nice shot.<br/>(Edited for the pun :P)</td>', 'Even at this distance I think I recognise the-too on the edges... Nice shot.(Edited for the pun :P)', '2011-04-10 08:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381107, 944384, 104230, '<td valign="top">Fun.</td>', 'Fun.', '2011-04-10 09:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381111, 944591, 117474, '<td valign="top">This has to be [uaer]Yo_Spiff[/user]''s. It reminds me so much of "the old timer" but with a trimmed face. <br/>Very nice portrait. I like how his head divides the brighter area on the right and the darker area to the left. <br/>Only criticism is that his moustache blends in with his face on the left, while it doesn''t on the right. If it was shot on a bright day there mightn''t have been much you could do about it though. <br/>Still a very nice character shot.</td>', 'This has to be [uaer]Yo_Spiff[/user]''s. It reminds me so much of "the old timer" but with a trimmed face. Very nice portrait. I like how his head divides the brighter area on the right and the darker area to the left. Only criticism is that his moustache blends in with his face on the left, while it doesn''t on the right. If it was shot on a bright day there mightn''t have been much you could do about it though. Still a very nice character shot.', '2011-04-10 10:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381135, 944052, 113411, '<td valign="top">Fabulous!!!!</td>', 'Fabulous!!!!', '2011-04-10 10:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381221, 944527, 76335, '<td valign="top">So good. The eyes and tight lips suggest a guarded, almost fearful, demeanor. What I like most about this is the energy. One can feel the years passing over him or pouring out of him. Stories to tell. Or that will never be told. <br/> <br/>More formally, I like the vertical lines -- in his shirt, his face and even his hair. Combined with the perfectly shallow DOF, they pull the viewer in. <br/> <br/>Excellent.</td>', 'So good. The eyes and tight lips suggest a guarded, almost fearful, demeanor. What I like most about this is the energy. One can feel the years passing over him or pouring out of him. Stories to tell. Or that will never be told.  More formally, I like the vertical lines -- in his shirt, his face and even his hair. Combined with the perfectly shallow DOF, they pull the viewer in.  Excellent.', '2011-04-10 12:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6381223, 943733, 76335, '<td valign="top">Wonderful feeling of intrusion or confinement. Great energy.</td>', 'Wonderful feeling of intrusion or confinement. Great energy.', '2011-04-10 12:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
