(6382070, 944584, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is funny. It''s like it''s making fun of something but still doing it perfectly, like a comedian who sings better than the person he''s doing an impression of. I love it.<br/> <br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'This is funny. It''s like it''s making fun of something but still doing it perfectly, like a comedian who sings better than the person he''s doing an impression of. I love it.  Posthumous Red Ribbon ', '2011-04-10 23:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6382071, 943360, 104230, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the light on either side of the ridge, and nice leading line.  Personally, I might have called it something other than "clouds" as they have the supporting role here, in my view, lovely though they are!</td>', 'Great capture of the light on either side of the ridge, and nice leading line.  Personally, I might have called it something other than "clouds" as they have the supporting role here, in my view, lovely though they are!', '2011-04-10 23:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
