(6382270, 944410, 69034, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by franktheyank:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nice image Mike. The composition is great, love the play of the striped shadows. Also congrats for being your second highest score. I do think that some of the highlights are a tad blown out though. Did you use the recovery slider in camera raw? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No, I didn''t.  I tend not to convert from RAW. . .I probably blew a some of those areas myself during processing with over use of dodge.   I really appreciate the kind words, been trying to learn my camera and the software simultaneously.  It was really cool watching this one spar with my top two entries until voting finished.  LOL.</td>', 'Originally posted by franktheyank: Very nice image Mike. The composition is great, love the play of the striped shadows. Also congrats for being your second highest score. I do think that some of the highlights are a tad blown out though. Did you use the recovery slider in camera raw?   No, I didn''t.  I tend not to convert from RAW. . .I probably blew a some of those areas myself during processing with over use of dodge.   I really appreciate the kind words, been trying to learn my camera and the software simultaneously.  It was really cool watching this one spar with my top two entries until voting finished.  LOL.', '2011-04-11 01:30:47.000000', NULL, 0),
