(6383113, 943926, 67697, '<td valign="top">I have to say that when I saw this in voting, I wondered if someone was doing a modern art tribute to <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=53814" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">pointandshoot</a> with all the cat paw shots he does.  That is what the stripe looked like to me - like a paw reaching in for the vine.  Really cool idea for a black and white.</td>', 'I have to say that when I saw this in voting, I wondered if someone was doing a modern art tribute to  pointandshoot with all the cat paw shots he does.  That is what the stripe looked like to me - like a paw reaching in for the vine.  Really cool idea for a black and white.', '2011-04-11 16:35:50.000000', NULL, 0),
