(6383339, 943919, 109387, '<td valign="top">Thank you everybody. I noticed the optical illusion and I thought about fixing it, but I left it. <br/> <br/>I guess it was difficult to choose which were the best pics in this challenge: except for the first one (IMO by far the best one) the others, at least until the 30th, were at a similar level.<br/> <br/>But I''m pretty satisfied of this image, there was a wonderful light over the rocks and I hope to be back there very soon.<br/> <br/>Ciao!</td>', 'Thank you everybody. I noticed the optical illusion and I thought about fixing it, but I left it.  I guess it was difficult to choose which were the best pics in this challenge: except for the first one (IMO by far the best one) the others, at least until the 30th, were at a similar level. But I''m pretty satisfied of this image, there was a wonderful light over the rocks and I hope to be back there very soon. Ciao!', '2011-04-11 21:02:37.000000', NULL, 0),
