(6384075, 944527, 117474, '<td valign="top">Meant to say it earlier. This is a wonderful portrait. I love the bokeh and circles in  the background. Excellent expression on his face. Wonderful tones too. I love this style of portrait! Unfortunately I''m too shy to approach people and ask them if I can take their photo and my father hates getting photographed. I''m doomed! :-)</td>', 'Meant to say it earlier. This is a wonderful portrait. I love the bokeh and circles in  the background. Excellent expression on his face. Wonderful tones too. I love this style of portrait! Unfortunately I''m too shy to approach people and ask them if I can take their photo and my father hates getting photographed. I''m doomed! :-)', '2011-04-12 20:08:43.000000', NULL, 0),
