(6384155, 943462, 86447, '<td valign="top"><u><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> Oddly ... This looks like an outtake of the Fine Arts challenge to me.   *sigh*<br/> <br/>I''d like it better without the mask for Black and white.   A clean... clear... BW shot... nothing... err... ''weird''.  <br/> <br/>But, then again, I might be weird.  *sigh*<br/> <br/>(not voting) </i></td></tr></table></u> <br/> <br/>Ha!  I''m so rarely ever right... Allow me a moment, please...  <br/> <br/>Thanks.   <br/> <br/>Now... this is really well done.   I lol''d at your comments.    Whatchagunnado when the model wants to be nekkid with a mask in the tub??  LOL!!<br/> <br/>Congrats on your ribbon, Paul!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-12 20:33:48.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: Oddly ... This looks like an outtake of the Fine Arts challenge to me.   *sigh* I''d like it better without the mask for Black and white.   A clean... clear... BW shot... nothing... err... ''weird''.   But, then again, I might be weird.  *sigh* (not voting)   Ha!  I''m so rarely ever right... Allow me a moment, please...   Thanks.    Now... this is really well done.   I lol''d at your comments.    Whatchagunnado when the model wants to be nekkid with a mask in the tub??  LOL!! Congrats on your ribbon, Paul!', '2011-04-12 21:33:29.000000', '2011-04-12 21:33:48.000000', 0),
