(6385102, 943888, 90947, '<td valign="top">You sure do a superb job with pretty young ladies.  (Oh, that sounds awful, but I mean it in the very best sense) I love this shot and the rest of your work.</td>', 'You sure do a superb job with pretty young ladies.  (Oh, that sounds awful, but I mean it in the very best sense) I love this shot and the rest of your work.', '2011-04-13 14:12:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6385114, 944586, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this one but to me, the crop is too tight.  Any time you see animals in a grazing situation, unless it is really filling the frame, I think part of the countryside needs to be included. The shadow tones are particularly dark which might seem a bit forced to some. :) I gave it a 6. )</td>', 'I like this one but to me, the crop is too tight.  Any time you see animals in a grazing situation, unless it is really filling the frame, I think part of the countryside needs to be included. The shadow tones are particularly dark which might seem a bit forced to some. :) I gave it a 6. )', '2011-04-13 14:23:20.000000', NULL, 0),
